[2026-03-14T20:09:48.406Z] {"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001","id":"msg_01Fa5KUmUtb4NnF5ZmkEU5eH","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01QVGYPGPPQvUjFKASNgEaW9","name":"Read","input":{"file_path":"/repo/apps/AirbnbClone/docs/tests.md","offset":100,"limit":100},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":7,"cache_creation_input_tokens":3352,"cache_read_input_tokens":36004,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":3352,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":4,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_0114QLLRUEx1moAjra4ugLk7","session_id":"c9a6ccec-d137-4f6f-8279-aaabb9d3d1bc","uuid":"4124b0e4-bf61-4afe-b370-c1152404ef68"}
[2026-03-14T20:09:48.579Z] {"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01QVGYPGPPQvUjFKASNgEaW9","type":"tool_result","content":"   100→- **Expected:** The property grid updates to show only properties where the city matches \"Paris\". Properties in other cities are not displayed.\n   101→\n   102→#### Test: Search by check-in and check-out dates filters results\n   103→- **Initial state:** User is on the home page. Some properties have bookings that overlap with the selected dates.\n   104→- **Action:** User selects a check-in date of \"2026-04-01\" and a check-out date of \"2026-04-05\" using the date pickers, then clicks the search button.\n   105→- **Expected:** The property grid updates to show only properties that are available (not fully booked) for the selected date range. The date pickers display the selected dates in a readable format.\n   106→\n   107→#### Test: Search by guest count filters results\n   108→- **Initial state:** User is on the home page. Properties exist with max_guests values of 2, 4, and 8.\n   109→- **Action:** User sets the guest count to 5 and clicks the search button.\n   110→- **Expected:** The property grid updates to show only properties where max_guests >= 5. Properties with fewer guest capacity are hidden.\n   111→\n   112→#### Test: Combined search with all fields filters results\n   113→- **Initial state:** User is on the home page. Multiple properties exist with varying locations, availability, and guest capacities.\n   114→- **Action:** User types \"New York\" in the location field, selects check-in \"2026-05-10\" and check-out \"2026-05-15\", sets guests to 3, and clicks the search button.\n   115→- **Expected:** The property grid shows only properties in New York that are available for those dates and accommodate at least 3 guests.\n   116→\n   117→#### Test: Clearing search fields and re-searching shows all results\n   118→- **Initial state:** User has performed a search for \"Paris\" and the grid shows filtered results.\n   119→- **Action:** User clears the location field (making it empty) and clicks the search button.\n   120→- **Expected:** The property grid resets to show all properties (unfiltered by location).\n   121→\n   122→#### Test: Search bar is functional on repeated use\n   123→- **Initial state:** User is on the home page.\n   124→- **Action:** User searches for \"Paris\", views results, then clears the location field, types \"Tokyo\", and searches again.\n   125→- **Expected:** The first search shows only Paris properties. After the second search, the grid updates to show only Tokyo properties. The location input correctly reflects \"Tokyo\".\n   126→\n   127→#### Test: Check-in date picker prevents selecting past dates\n   128→- **Initial state:** User is on the home page.\n   129→- **Action:** User opens the check-in date picker.\n   130→- **Expected:** Dates before today are disabled/grayed out and cannot be selected.\n   131→\n   132→#### Test: Check-out date must be after check-in date\n   133→- **Initial state:** User is on the home page and has selected a check-in date of \"2026-04-10\".\n   134→- **Action:** User opens the check-out date picker.\n   135→- **Expected:** Dates on or before \"2026-04-10\" are disabled/grayed out and cannot be selected. Only dates after the check-in date are selectable.\n   136→\n   137→#### Test: Guest count selector enforces minimum of 1\n   138→- **Initial state:** User is on the home page.\n   139→- **Action:** User interacts with the guest count selector.\n   140→- **Expected:** The minimum selectable value is 1. The user cannot set the guest count to 0 or a negative number.\n   141→\n   142→### Component: CategoryFilter\n   143→\n   144→#### Test: Category filter bar displays all property type chips\n   145→- **Initial state:** User navigates to the home page (`/`).\n   146→- **Expected:** A horizontal scrollable bar of category chips is displayed below the search bar. Chips are shown for each property type: \"Apartment\", \"House\", \"Cabin\", \"Villa\", \"Condo\", \"Loft\", \"Cottage\", \"Townhouse\". No chip is selected by default (all properties are shown).\n   147→\n   148→#### Test: Clicking a category chip filters properties by that type\n   149→- **Initial state:** User is on the home page. Properties of various types exist (apartments, houses, cabins, etc.).\n   150→- **Action:** User clicks the \"Cabin\" chip.\n   151→- **Expected:** The \"Cabin\" chip becomes visually selected/highlighted (e.g., bold outline or filled background). The property grid updates to show only properties with property_type \"Cabin\".\n   152→\n   153→#### Test: Clicking the selected category chip deselects it and shows all properties\n   154→- **Initial state:** User is on the home page with the \"Cabin\" chip currently selected.\n   155→- **Action:** User clicks the \"Cabin\" chip again.\n   156→- **Expected:** The \"Cabin\" chip returns to its unselected appearance. The property grid shows all properties again (no category filter applied).\n   157→\n   158→#### Test: Switching between category chips updates the filter\n   159→- **Initial state:** User is on the home page with the \"Cabin\" chip selected, showing only cabin properties.\n   160→- **Action:** User clicks the \"Villa\" chip.\n   161→- **Expected:** The \"Cabin\" chip becomes unselected and the \"Villa\" chip becomes selected/highlighted. The property grid updates to show only properties with property_type \"Villa\".\n   162→\n   163→#### Test: Category filter works in combination with search bar\n   164→- **Initial state:** User is on the home page. Properties exist: a cabin in Paris, an apartment in Paris, and a cabin in Tokyo.\n   165→- **Action:** User types \"Paris\" in the search bar location field and clicks search, then clicks the \"Cabin\" chip.\n   166→- **Expected:** The property grid shows only cabin properties in Paris. Both the search and category filters are applied simultaneously.\n   167→\n   168→#### Test: Category filter bar is horizontally scrollable when chips overflow\n   169→- **Initial state:** User is on the home page on a narrow viewport where all chips don't fit in one row.\n   170→- **Expected:** The category filter bar is horizontally scrollable. The user can scroll left/right to see all property type chips.\n   171→\n   172→#### Test: Category chip is functional on repeated use\n   173→- **Initial state:** User is on the home page.\n   174→- **Action:** User clicks \"Apartment\" (filtered), then clicks \"House\" (switches filter), then clicks \"House\" again (deselects), then clicks \"Cabin\" (filtered again).\n   175→- **Expected:** Each click correctly updates the selected chip and the property grid filters. The final state shows only cabin properties with the \"Cabin\" chip highlighted.\n   176→\n   177→### Component: PropertyGrid\n   178→\n   179→#### Test: Property grid displays properties in a responsive grid layout\n   180→- **Initial state:** User navigates to the home page. Multiple properties exist in the database.\n   181→- **Expected:** Properties are displayed in a responsive grid: 1 column on mobile, 2 columns on tablet, 3-4 columns on desktop. Each property is rendered as a PropertyCard.\n   182→\n   183→#### Test: Property grid shows message when no properties match filters\n   184→- **Initial state:** User is on the home page.\n   185→- **Action:** User searches for a location with no matching properties (e.g., \"Atlantis\").\n   186→- **Expected:** The property grid area displays a \"No properties found\" message instead of an empty grid. The message suggests adjusting filters or search criteria.\n   187→\n   188→#### Test: Property grid loads and displays properties from API on initial page load\n   189→- **Initial state:** User navigates to the home page. Properties exist in the database.\n   190→- **Expected:** The grid fetches properties via `GET /api/properties` and displays property cards. While loading, a loading indicator is shown. Once loaded, the property cards appear with correct data.\n   191→\n   192→### Component: PropertyCard\n   193→\n   194→#### Test: Property card displays all required information\n   195→- **Initial state:** User is on the home page. A property exists with title \"Cozy Cabin\", city \"Aspen\", country \"US\", property_type \"Cabin\", price_per_night 150, an average rating of 4.5, and 12 reviews.\n   196→- **Expected:** The property card shows: the main property image at the top, a \"Cabin\" property type badge, the title \"Cozy Cabin\", location \"Aspen, US\", \"$150 / night\" price, and a star icon with \"4.5 (12 reviews)\" rating display.\n   197→\n   198→#### Test: Property card shows property image\n   199→- **Initial state:** User is on the home page. A property exists with at least one image (the first image by display_order)."}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_0114QLLRUEx1moAjra4ugLk7","session_id":"c9a6ccec-d137-4f6f-8279-aaabb9d3d1bc","uuid":"39763cc2-b28f-4c7e-ace8-a7ccc65552e4"}
