[2026-03-14T20:10:08.055Z] {"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_0114QLLRUEx1moAjra4ugLk7","type":"tool_result","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Excellent! Let me create a comprehensive summary of my findings.\n\n## Airbnb Clone App - Exploration Report\n\n### 1. App Directory Name\n- **Path:** `/repo/apps/AirbnbClone`\n\n### 2. Test Specifications Document\n- **Path:** `/repo/apps/AirbnbClone/docs/tests.md`\n- **Content:** Comprehensive test specifications covering:\n  - Authentication (Auth page, Login, Register forms)\n  - Search functionality (location, dates, guest count)\n  - Category filtering (property types)\n  - Property Grid and Property Cards\n  - Favorite Button functionality\n  - Filters Panel (price, bedrooms, amenities)\n  - Pagination\n\n### 3. Existing Test Files\n- `/repo/apps/AirbnbClone/tests/auth.spec.ts` - Authentication tests\n- `/repo/apps/AirbnbClone/tests/search.spec.ts` - Search bar and filter tests\n- `/repo/apps/AirbnbClone/tests/category-filter.spec.ts` - Category filter tests\n\n### 4. Playwright Configuration\n- **Path:** `/repo/apps/AirbnbClone/playwright.config.ts`\n- **Key Settings:**\n  - Test directory: `./tests`\n  - Timeout: 60000ms\n  - Workers: 1 (sequential execution)\n  - Base URL: `http://localhost:8888`\n  - Web server: Netlify Dev on port 8888\n  - Reporter: Replay reporter, JSON, and HTML reporters\n  - Uses `@replayio/playwright` for recording\n\n### 5. Component Source Code\n\n#### PropertyGrid Component\n- **Path:** `/repo/apps/AirbnbClone/src/components/PropertyGrid.tsx`\n- **Features:**\n  - Responsive grid layout (1 col mobile, 2 col tablet, 3-4 col desktop)\n  - Loading state with spinner (testid: `property-grid-loading`)\n  - Empty state message (testid: `property-grid-empty`)\n  - Maps properties to PropertyCard components\n  - Has testid: `property-grid`\n\n#### PropertyCard Component\n- **Path:** `/repo/apps/AirbnbClone/src/components/PropertyCard.tsx`\n- **Features:**\n  - Displays main image with group hover effect\n  - Property type badge (top-left)\n  - FavoriteButton component (top-right)\n  - Title, location (city, country)\n  - Price per night\n  - Star rating with review count or \"New\" label\n  - Click handler navigates to `/properties/{id}`\n  - Testid format: `property-card-{property.id}`\n\n#### FavoriteButton Component\n- **Path:** `/repo/apps/AirbnbClone/src/components/FavoriteButton.tsx`\n- **Features:**\n  - Uses React Redux (selectors and dispatch)\n  - Only renders if user is logged in (checks currentUser)\n  - Dispatches `addFavorite` and `removeFavorite` actions\n  - Heart icon (unfilled when not favorited, filled red when favorited)\n  - Event handling with preventDefault and stopPropagation\n  - Testid format: `favorite-button-{propertyId}`\n  - Uses state from `state.favorites.propertyIds` and `state.auth.currentUser`\n\n### 6. Seed Data File\n- **Path:** `/repo/apps/AirbnbClone/scripts/seed-db.ts`\n- **Contents:**\n  - **Users:** 4 test users (Sarah Chen - host, Mike Johnson - host, Emma Wilson - guest, Alex Rivera - guest)\n  - **Properties:** 5 properties\n    - b1111111: Cozy Downtown Loft (New York, NY) - $150/night, Loft\n    - b2222222: Beachfront Villa (Miami, FL) - $450/night, Villa\n    - b3333333: Mountain Cabin Retreat (Asheville, NC) - $200/night, Cabin\n    - b4444444: Modern Austin Apartment (Austin, TX) - $120/night, Apartment\n    - b5555555: Historic Townhouse (Washington, DC) - $275/night, Townhouse\n  - **Property Images:** Multiple images per property with display order\n  - **Amenities:** 18 amenities organized by category (Essentials, Features, Safety, Location)\n  - **Property Amenities:** Associations between properties and amenities\n  - **Bookings:** 6 test bookings with various statuses\n  - **Reviews:** 2 test reviews\n  - **Favorites:** 4 test favorite associations\n\n### 7. API Endpoints\n\n#### Properties Endpoint\n- **Path:** `/repo/apps/AirbnbClone/netlify/functions/properties.ts`\n- **Methods:**\n  - `GET /api/properties` - List properties with filtering\n    - Query params: city, check_in, check_out, guests, property_type, min_price, max_price, min_bedrooms, min_beds, min_bathrooms, amenities, page, limit\n    - Returns: { properties, total, page, limit, totalPages }\n    - Filters by availability based on bookings\n    - Includes main_image, avg_rating, review_count\n  - `GET /api/properties/:id` - Get single property with details\n    - Returns: property + images + amenities + reviews + host info\n  - `POST /api/properties` - Create new property\n  - `PUT /api/properties/:id` - Update property\n  - `DELETE /api/properties/:id` - Soft delete (sets is_active=false)\n\n#### Favorites Endpoint\n- **Path:** `/repo/apps/AirbnbClone/netlify/functions/favorites.ts`\n- **Methods:**\n  - `GET /api/favorites?user_id={userId}` - Get user's favorites\n    - Returns: Array of { property_id, created_at }\n  - `POST /api/favorites` - Add favorite\n    - Body: { user_id, property_id }\n  - `DELETE /api/favorites/:propertyId?user_id={userId}` - Remove favorite\n\n#### Database Helper\n- **Path:** `/repo/apps/AirbnbClone/netlify/functions/db.ts`\n- Simple wrapper that returns Neon SQL client initialized with DATABASE_URL env var\n\n#### Other API Endpoints\n- `/repo/apps/AirbnbClone/netlify/functions/auth.ts` - Authentication (login/register)\n- `/repo/apps/AirbnbClone/netlify/functions/amenities.ts` - Get available amenities\n- `/repo/apps/AirbnbClone/netlify/functions/bookings.ts` - Booking management\n- `/repo/apps/AirbnbClone/netlify/functions/reviews.ts` - Review management\n- `/repo/apps/AirbnbClone/netlify/functions/users.ts` - User management\n- `/repo/apps/AirbnbClone/netlify/functions/host-stats.ts` - Host statistics\n- `/repo/apps/AirbnbClone/netlify/functions/host-bookings.ts` - Host's bookings\n- `/repo/apps/AirbnbClone/netlify/functions/host-listings.ts` - Host's listings\n- `/repo/apps/AirbnbClone/netlify/functions/property-images.ts` - Property images management\n\n### 8. Netlify Functions Directory Structure\n- **Path:** `/repo/apps/AirbnbClone/netlify/functions/`\n- **Contains:** 12 TypeScript function files as listed above\n- Each function is a standalone handler for specific domain (auth, properties, favorites, bookings, reviews, amenities, users, images, host operations)\n- All use the Neon database via the db.ts helper\n\n### Key Architecture Insights\n- **Frontend State:** Uses Redux (Redux Toolkit slices for auth, favorites, properties)\n- **Backend:** Serverless functions (Netlify Functions) with Neon PostgreSQL\n- **Database Schema:** Includes users, properties, bookings, reviews, favorites, amenities, property_images, property_amenities tables\n- **Testing:** Playwright with Replay.io integration for debugging\n- **Date Handling:** Uses ISO 8601 format (YYYY-MM-DD) for dates\n- **Data Validation:** Query parameters parsed and validated in endpoints"},{"type":"text","text":"agentId: a215d5ade3935425a (for resuming to continue this agent's work if needed)\n<usage>total_tokens: 48980\ntool_uses: 25\nduration_ms: 34217</usage>"}]}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"c9a6ccec-d137-4f6f-8279-aaabb9d3d1bc","uuid":"fb485baa-fd15-46cc-bb02-654d71718d3c","tool_use_result":{"status":"completed","prompt":"Explore the airbnb clone app in /repo/apps/. Find:\n1. The app directory name\n2. docs/tests.md - the test specifications\n3. The existing test files\n4. The playwright config\n5. The property grid component, property card component, and favorite button component source code\n6. The seed data file\n7. Any existing API endpoints related to properties and favorites\n8. The netlify functions directory structure\n\nBe thorough - read the key component files and API endpoints.","agentId":"a215d5ade3935425a","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Excellent! Let me create a comprehensive summary of my findings.\n\n## Airbnb Clone App - Exploration Report\n\n### 1. App Directory Name\n- **Path:** `/repo/